# Local connection strings, and the OIDC token `vercel link` writes into
# .env.local. The deployed app reads DATABASE_URL from Vercel project settings;
# nothing with a credential in it belongs in the repo. The glob is deliberately
# broad — it covers .env, .env.local, .env.production and anything else the
# Vercel CLI decides to write here.
.env*
